{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10297911","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10297911","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1029791101:0":{"text":"네. 새로운 상업 노선이 곧 열릴 거예요!","source_cn":"嗯，新的商贸路线，准备开启！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8799B3AC187B7970","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1029791102:0":{"text":"도련님이야 말 한 마디면 되겠지만, 기사단은 신경 쓸 일이 한둘이 아니라고요.","source_cn":"你这边一句话的事，骑士团可要费不少心思。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2D595EE4EA0CE4B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1029791103:1":{"text":"오가는 사람들의 신원을 확인하고, 금지 품목 반입 여부도 조사해야 하고...","source_cn":"查验往来人员的身份，是否携带了违禁品——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E96CC54C9A8E60C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1029791104:1":{"text":"사람이 많아지면 대체로 치안이 나빠지기 마련이니까요...","source_cn":"而且人一多起来，治安多半也会变差……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB21081D6D9A10156","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1029791105:1":{"text":"하필 장군님이 안 계실 때에 이런 귀찮은 일까지 떠맡겨서 죄송해요.","source_cn":"抱歉，在将军不在的时候给你们添了这么多麻烦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x23EE07DB4A630A1D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1029791106:1":{"text":"그래서 이번 수익의 30%로 기사단을 지원하는 재단을 만들 생각이에요.","source_cn":"本次的收益，我会拿出三成，建立一个基金，援助骑士团的建设。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x82513997242BA453","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1029791107:1":{"text":"통도 크셔라. 하지만 그런 큰일은 제가 결정할 게 아니에요. 장군님이 결정하셔야죠.","source_cn":"真够阔气的，不过这种大事我可做不了主，只能让将军来拍板。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5456A59BB5F6EC81","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1029791108:1":{"text":"저에게 떠넘겨진 업무량은... 뭐, 개인적인 불행이라고 해둘게요.","source_cn":"至于我个人的工作量——看样子这也只能是我不幸的命运了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x046D78CDCD222E5A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:罗万":{"text":"로완","source":"罗万","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:维伦":{"text":"발렌","source":"维伦","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":2}}